  1971	def _check_mcp_servers(
  1972	    plans: list[SkillPlan], project_root: Path, agents: list[str], *, alias: str = ""
  1973	) -> tuple[dict[str, dict[str, list[str]]], list[str]]:
  1974	    """Verify declared MCP servers against the target agent environments.
  1975	
  1976	    Returns, per skill, the agents where each declared server was found, plus
  1977	    warnings for servers that are configured but statically unlikely to run:
  1978	    a stdio command missing from PATH, or a project-only declaration that the
  1979	    agent holds pending until the checkout is trusted.
  1980	    Raises InstallError when a requirement is not satisfied.
